{"type":"message","id":"09b6c308","parentId":"10407c37","timestamp":"2026-03-25T04:46:26.662Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking what skills I currently have. Let me check my available skills listed in the system prompt and my workspace files.\n\nFrom the system prompt, I have these skills available:\n- feishu-bitable - 飞书多维表格\n- feishu-calendar - 飞书日历与日程管理\n- feishu-channel-rules - Lark channel output rules\n- feishu-create-doc - 创建飞书云文档\n- feishu-fetch-doc - 获取飞书云文档内容\n- feishu-im-read - 飞书 IM 消息读取\n- feishu-task - 飞书任务管理\n- feishu-troubleshoot - 飞书插件问题排查\n- feishu-update-doc - 更新飞书云文档\n- healthcheck - Host security\n- node-connect - Diagnose node connection\n- skill-creator - Create/edit skills\n- weather - Get weather\n\nLet me give a concise overview of what I can do.","thinkingSignature":"dbf59d1dcfb601a04617d1734c9e3daf8693739ef394657f26959d8a8da5ada8"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n目前我主要有这些技能：\n\n**📅 飞书相关**\n- 日历/日程管理（创建会议、查忙闲、改日程等）\n- 消息读取（群聊/单聊历史、搜索消息、下载图片/文件）\n- 云文档（创建、读取、更新文档）\n- 多维表格（创建表格、管理记录、筛选查询）\n- 任务管理（创建任务、清单、子任务）\n- 搜索（搜索文档、Wiki、人员）\n\n**🌤️ 其他**\n- 天气查询\n- 网页搜索/获取网页内容\n- 技能创建（如果你想给我加新技能）\n\n基本上飞书相关的操作我都能搞，有啥需要的尽管说～\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":108,"output":354,"cacheRead":30463,"cacheWrite":515,"totalTokens":31440,"cost":{"input":0.0000324,"output":0.00042479999999999997,"cacheRead":0.0018277799999999998,"cacheWrite":0.000193125,"total":0.002478105}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774413977280,"responseId":"06129b9a86fdd5a30e18345ced6320ee"}}
